Speaking at the United Nations on 9 December 2019, Nicolás García Mayor asked how humanity intends to survive the crises it creates, what the plan is, and proposed a "revolution of priorities" in which taking care of one another becomes the organizing principle of preparedness.

A photograph of the intervention exists in the Foundation's archive and will be added to this record.
